      "why_it_failed": "The current engine supports only three bounded compensation shapes inside one transaction shell: one explicit boundary-to-handler binding whose handlers can replay in reverse completion order during transaction cancel, one synchronous throw-compensation end event that targets an already compensable activity through explicit `activityRef`, and one synchronous throw-compensation intermediate event that does the same before normal sequence-flow routing resumes.",
